twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	Parse error at 12:35: a `[]` subscript must be `borrows` — `v[i]` names a PLACE in the container, not a value read out of it. Write `func [](&var self, ...) borrows -> &var T`; a value-returning lookup is an ordinary named method
